start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc 2ch {[3dc 2ch]x3 2dc}@ring ss@top fo # ch 5 = 1 dc + ch 2
R2: {dc 2dc}@corner [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner]x3 {3dc 2ch}@corner ss@top fo # first dc = standing dc
R3: {dc 2dc}@corner [3dc@sp {3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner]x3 3dc@sp {3dc 2ch}@corner ss@top fo
R4: {dc 2dc}@corner [[3dc@sp]x2 {3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner]x3 [3dc@sp]x2 {3dc 2ch}@corner ss@top fo
R5: {dc 2dc}@corner [[3dc@sp]x3 {3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner]x3 [3dc@sp]x3 {3dc 2ch}@corner ss@top fo
R6: {hdc hdc}@corner [15hdc {2hdc 2ch 2hdc}@corner]x3 15hdc {2hdc 2ch}@corner ss@top fo # first hdc = standing hdc
